            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Shruti 1.4.36

- Mute All: a red button at the top of the Shruti panel silences everything coming out of the Mac in one click, for an emergency. Click Unmute All to bring the sound back.
- While everything is muted, the menu-bar icon turns into a red crossed speaker, whatever icon style you chose.

Requires macOS 14.2 or later; Apple silicon and Intel. Existing settings, app arrangements and window preferences are retained.
]]></description>
